usage: reptor mcp [-h] [--remove-fields REMOVE_FIELDS]
                  [--transport {stdio,sse}] [--mcp-debug MCP_DEBUG]

Starts the Model Context Protocol (MCP) server

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --remove-fields REMOVE_FIELDS
                        Comma-separated list of field names to remove from findings before sending to LLM (e.g., 'affected_components,internal_notes')
  --transport {stdio,sse}
                        Transport mode for MCP server (default: stdio)
  --mcp-debug MCP_DEBUG
                        Path to log file for debugging MCP communication
